  "body": "Be In By Christmas!  Elevated and just minutes from the beach, this is the kind of home where morning swims, sunset spas and easy coastal living can become part of the everyday.\r\n\r\nTop features you'll love:\r\n\r\n- Two bedrooms plus a separate outdoor office/studio\r\n- Modern kitchen\r\n- Multiple outdoor living & entertaining spaces\r\n- Built-in bench seating with clever integrated storage\r\n- Updated bathroom with excellent storage\r\n- Double-glazed double stack slider connecting the living space outdoors\r\n- Private deck and spa area with a glimpse of the sea and stunning sunsets\r\n- Fully fenced, private backyard – peace of mind for young kids and four-legged friends\r\n- Established fruit trees including orange, feijoa, lemon, apple, peach, nectarine and passionfruit, plus a veggie garden\r\n- Additional storage/garden shed\r\n- Carport plus additional off-street parking\r\n- Elevated and set back from the road for added privacy\r\n- An easy stroll to Red Beach and local amenities\r\n\r\nWhat the owners have loved most about living here is the Red Beach lifestyle. Being this close to the coast has meant daily beach walks and swims year-round, with the surf club less than a 10-minute walk away perfect for a morning coffee or a quick bite with an exceptional outlook.\r\n\r\nAnd it’s not just the beach that’s close. You’re right on the doorstep of multiple local parks, including the brand-new pump track, with Red Beach School, local shops and everyday amenities all within easy walking distance. It’s a genuinely central spot where so much of daily life can be done on foot.\r\n\r\nThe home feels tucked away and private with an easy connection between indoors and out and plenty of space to simply relax and enjoy your surroundings.\r\n\r\nSummer evenings are particularly special. Open up the living space, head out to the deck and finish the day in the spa with a glimpse of the sea and one of those beautiful west-facing sunsets.\r\n\r\nFor those already familiar with Red Beach, you’ll know just how good this pocket is. And for buyers coming from further afield, this is a chance to discover a genuinely relaxed coastal lifestyle – morning swims, evening walks and the beach becoming part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of privacy, position and proximity to the coast, 52B Bay Street is an opportunity to settle in and enjoy everything that makes Red Beach such a great place to call home.",
